<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GF Property renews cautionary on buy-in.</title>
<headline>GF Property renews cautionary on buy-in.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Fields Property Co Ltd renewed previous cautionary announcements on Wednesday saying that its major shareholder had received offers for the purchase of its shareholding in the company.</p>
<p>Negotiations with certain of these offerors were underway and shareholders should in the meantime exercise caution in their dealings, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003s</p>
</text>
